    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage, not around the whole end-to-end flow.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR end to end: encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, decoder.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes a dense carrier before any compact thought process runs. Windowing changes the carrier into local token groups while keeping the flow spatial. The repeated ticks happen inside DQ-CTM, with shared parameters across those ticks. The decoder reads the updated dense state after the thought stage finishes.",
